{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The current build is our 5.2 Early Access release. <strong>Our new 5.4 build (coming Summer 25') features an entirely new locomotion system, mechanics, destructible landscape, and more.</strong> A new Wild Americas experience from the ground up!\u00a0<br><br>If you purchased the previous build, we cannot wait for you to see the improvements. If you have not, give us a Wishlist and check back in when the game drops this summer. Make sure to check for our <strong>News and Announcements</strong> (see section below) for more details.<br><br>Thank you!<br><br>-MB</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">About the Game: <br><br>Armed with advanced GPR scanning equipment, players will have to employ their wit and expertise to catalog the island's natural resources, all while uncovering hidden conspiracies and schemes behind secret experiments, ancient artifacts, and old tales. Navigate treacherous terrain, climb rocky extensions, and delve deep into the island's underground network of caves and tunnels.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2246810?t=1745550119","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246810/3d6557ad649ddb928f8e95e9c8f5907f7692d7be/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745550119","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246810/4aff5c87274879eff7717af44103aab5063411d3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745550119","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246810/4aff5c87274879eff7717af44103aab5063411d3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745550119","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The player will use weapons (primarily firearms) to hunt and/or kill various animals. This will take place throughout the game and is the main combat loop. There will also be references to alcohol. For example, there is a character who runs a moonshine still."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The current build is our 5.2 Early Access release. <strong>Our new 5.4 build (coming Summer 25') features an entirely new locomotion system, mechanics, destructible landscape, and more.</strong> A new Wild Americas experience from the ground up!\u00a0<br><br>If you purchased the previous build, we cannot wait for you to see the improvements. If you have not, give us a Wishlist and check back in when the game drops this summer. Make sure to check for our <strong>News and Announcements</strong> (see section below) for more details.<br><br>Thank you!<br><br>-MB</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">About the Game: <br><br>Armed with advanced GPR scanning equipment, players will have to employ their wit and expertise to catalog the island's natural resources, all while uncovering hidden conspiracies and schemes behind secret experiments, ancient artifacts, and old tales. Navigate treacherous terrain, climb rocky extensions, and delve deep into the island's underground network of caves and tunnels.</p>","developers":["Upsetter Studios LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246810/225406666a92150481a9eadfce9a6f7d39bf2b51/header.jpg?t=1745550119","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Upsetter Studios, All Rights Reserved, 2025","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257120515,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120515/movie480.mp4?t=1743436561","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120515/movie_max.mp4?t=1743436561"},"name":"Mountain Island, Present Day","thumbnail":"https://shar